真棒 我手机坏了 这全怪你们
Great. My phone is broken, and it's your fault.

51
00:01:52,500 --> 00:01:53,660
这黑锅从何而来
How do you figure that?

52
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:55,620
因为我昨晚得朝松鼠扔手机
Because I had to throw it at some squirrels last night

53
