104
00:03:29,640 --> 00:03:33,300
现在我要去网上买更多拖鞋了
Now, I have to go and buy more slippers online.

105
00:03:33,460 --> 00:03:34,740
尽量别让电脑崩溃[撞]了
Try not to crash the computer.

106
