我们天天见面了这么多天啊 佛朗西斯科
Okay. We have spent every day together, Francisco.

514
00:18:23,140 --> 00:18:24,380
我有点生气啊
I'm a little offended.

515
00:18:24,700 --> 00:18:26,360
那这话听完你可能会消点气
Oh. Well, if it makes you feel any better,

516
00:18:26,420 --> 00:18:27,480
我的名字其实是佛南多
my name's actually Fernando.

517
00:18:29,446 --> 00:18:30,487
的确是消了气
Oh. ?It does help.

518
00:18:33,596 --> 00:18:34,127
她在那里
Ah! There she is.

519
00:18:34,166 --> 00:18:35,567
海莉
Haley!

520
00:18:36,676 --> 00:18:38,416
-海莉 -要命啦
- Haley! - Oh, my God!

521
00:18:38,620 --> 00:18:39,820
这是什么鬼
What is going on?!

522
00:18:40,080 --> 00:18:42,040
靠 没有那钥匙不行啊
Damn it! We need those keys!

523
00:18:42,740 --> 00:18:44,000
我们得在演唱会
Got to get to the concert before the roadies

524
00:18:44,005 --> 00:18:46,205
他们选辣妹去后台派对前就到场啊
pick all the hot chicks that get to party backstage.

525
00:18:46,315 --> 00:18:46,966
我有点迷糊了
I'm confused.

526
00:18:46,975 --> 00:18:49,445
-哪怕是当年 他们也不.... -海莉
- Even back in the day, they weren't exactly... - ?Haley!

527
00:18:50,780 --> 00:18:52,960
这样吧 我去跟她取
You know what? I'll go get them.

528
00:18:53,200 --> 00:18:54,540
不 别 不许你去
No. No. You can't.

529
00:18:55,220 --> 00:18:55,840
今天不许
Um, not today.

530
00:18:56,620 --> 00:18:57,980
你也相信诅咒 对吧
You believe in the curse, don't you?

531
00:18:58,040 --> 00:18:59,620
我也搞不懂啊
I don't understand it.

532
00:18:59,740 --> 00:19:01,520
可是你今天一直像衰神附身
Bad things have been happening to you all day.

533
00:19:01,600 --> 00:19:01,920
或许...
Maybe...

534
00:19:02,500 --> 00:19:03,600
或许就是那内裤在搞鬼
Maybe it's the underwear.

535
00:19:03,760 --> 00:19:05,380
我... 我不能冒这个险
I just -- I can't take a chance.

536
00:19:05,800 --> 00:19:07,380
-你待在这吧 -不行不行不行
- You stay here. - No, no, no, no, no.

537
00:19:07,400 --> 00:19:09,540
能发生在我身上最糟糕的事
You getting hurt is the worst possible thing

538
00:19:09,540 --> 00:19:10,420
就是我的宝贝老婆受伤
that could happen to me. ?

539
00:19:11,540 --> 00:19:12,920
告诉孩子们我爱他们
Tell the kids I love them.

540
00:19:13,093 --> 00:19:13,734
亲爱的
Oh, honey.

541
00:19:13,893 --> 00:19:15,483
你... 你没穿胸罩吗
Are you, uh -- Are you not wearing a bra?

542
00:19:17,213 --> 00:19:18,134
好吧 那你小心点
All right, be safe.

543
00:19:22,900 --> 00:19:24,340
我的老天
Oh, my God.

544
00:19:25,380 --> 00:19:26,160
那人是邓菲
That's Dunphy.

545
00:19:26,562 --> 00:19:28,032
第一个打中他的人赢50块怎么样
50 bucks to the first guy who hits him, huh?

546
00:19:28,420 --> 00:19:28,680
开始
Go.

547
00:19:31,302 --> 00:19:32,323
海莉
Haley!

548
00:19:34,252 --> 00:19:35,273
爸
Oh, Dad?

549
00:19:36,000 --> 00:19:37,040
好的 听我说
Okay, listen.

550
00:19:37,040 --> 00:19:39,960
我的车钥匙丢了 我需要你那份备用的
I lost my car keys. I need the spare set.

551
00:19:40,080 --> 00:19:41,500
我知道我这样算说一套做一套
I know that makes me a hypocrite.

552
00:19:42,180 --> 00:19:44,060
你完全有权生我的气
But you have every right to be angry with me.

553
00:19:44,220 --> 00:19:47,000
有这么多该感恩的事情 我怎么会生气
How could I be angry when there's so much to be grateful for?

554
00:19:47,861 --> 00:19:49,302
那个... 是书吗
Is that a -- a book?

555
00:19:49,360 --> 00:19:51,540
多亏你没给我新买手机 我才有幸读到它
I never would have picked it up if you had bought me a new phone.

556
00:19:52,520 --> 00:19:56,120
你长了点白头发 我喜欢
You've gotten a little gray. I like it.

557
00:19:58,400 --> 00:20:00,000
宝贝 给我钥匙
Honey...the keys?

558
00:20:00,160 --> 00:20:02,300
对不起 刚才被这些黄蜂给分散心思了
Sorry. I was distracted by those bumblebees.

559
00:20:03,140 --> 00:20:06,120
你听 它们在互相交流呢
Shh, listen -- they're talking to each other.

560
00:20:19,319 --> 00:20:20,609
是贱人格尔吗
Is that freakin' Gil?

561
00:20:21,039 --> 00:20:23,399
爽 爽爽爽
Yes! Yes, yes, yes!

562
00:20:23,609 --> 00:20:26,328
这程度的事每天都可能发生
Well, that could happen any day.

563
00:20:28,620 --> 00:20:30,660
还没死 让暴风雨来得更猛烈一些
He's still moving! Machine-gun him!

564
00:20:30,848 --> 00:20:32,079
用最快速度连发
Just hit as fast as you can!

565
00:20:32,240 --> 00:20:34,560
天啊 他这是要我亲命啊
Dear God! He's got me dialed in!

566
00:20:39,040 --> 00:20:39,680
早安啊 两位
Morning guys.

567
00:20:39,760 --> 00:20:41,460
你们错过了美好的日出
You missed a beautiful sunrise.

568
00:20:42,020 --> 00:20:44,600
这几天所度过的无手机生活
You know, living without a phone these past few days

569
00:20:44,600 --> 00:20:46,120
简直像上天的恩赐
has been such a gift.

570
00:20:46,460 --> 00:20:47,920
所看到的颜色更鲜艳了
Colors are brighter.

571
00:20:48,400 --> 00:20:49,380
尝到的味道也更美味
Tastes are tastier.

572
00:20:49,500 --> 00:20:50,940
你们吃过桃子吗
Have you ever eaten a peach?

573
00:20:51,140 --> 00:20:53,140
我是指真的品尝过桃子
I mean really eaten a peach?

574
00:20:53,556 --> 00:20:55,276
大多数我都写在我的短文里了
Well, most of it is in my short story.

575
00:20:55,276 --> 00:20:57,966
但最棒的部分 是我真正地认识了你们
The best part though, is really getting to know you two.

576
00:20:58,400 --> 00:21:00,260
老爸 你真的好有趣
Dad, you are so funny.

577
00:21:00,840 --> 00:21:02,400
你还有最温暖的目光
You have such kind eyes.

578
00:21:02,480 --> 00:21:05,300
老妈 你是一个衣柜公司的董事长
And mom, president of a closet company?

579
00:21:05,300 --> 00:21:06,800
太厉害啦
Way to go!

580
00:21:08,005 --> 00:21:10,775
所以分别也变得好艰难
I guess that's why it makes so hard to say goodbye.

581
00:21:12,520 --> 00:21:14,280
今早到的 卢克帮我设置好了
Came in this morning. Luke set it up for me.

582
00:21:14,400 --> 00:21:15,960
他真的长大了呢
He really shot up huh?

583
00:21:16,740 --> 00:21:17,180
总而言之
Anyway.

584
00:21:17,920 --> 00:21:19,080
在接下来的日子里
In the weeks to come,

585
00:21:19,080 --> 00:21:20,340
尽量记得...
try and remember that...

586
00:21:21,600 --> 00:21:22,760
这臭婊子
That skank!

587
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:23,860
别想
No way!
